Req. probability = (7 def 1 fair) or (8 defective)
$$\begin{array}{l}
\text { Req. probability }=\frac{\left(10^{7} \times 90\right) \times 8+10^{8}}{100^{8}} \\
=\frac{72 \times 10^{8}+10^{8}}{100^{8}}=\frac{73}{10^{8}}
\end{array}$$

